<title>JAPAN: Shiseido to buy one of Helene Curtis's Japan units.</title>
<headline>Shiseido to buy one of Helene Curtis's Japan units.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiseido Co Ltd said on Monday it had signed an agreement to buy one of the Japanese units of Helene Curtis Industries Inc .</p>
<p>Shiseido will hold a news conference at 2 p.m. (0500 GMT) to annnounce details of its purchase of the unit, a wholesaler of hair products, a company spokesman said.</p>
</text>
